---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Crumbs from "../components/Crumbs.astro";
import RelatedLinks from "../components/RelatedLinks.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";

const faqs = [
  {
    q: "Do you replace our PM or BI lead?",
    a: "No. We sit alongside them: scope, vendors, timelines, and the last-mile work of training and adoption so the model actually gets used.",
  },
  {
    q: "Is this for a chatbot program?",
    a: "It is for analytics and Power BI programs. Asking a certified model can be in the plan once that model exists.",
  },
  {
    q: "How long is a typical engagement?",
    a: "Usually a defined initiative (a model cutover, a first certified dataset, a dashboard program) rather than an open-ended staff-aug seat.",
  },
];

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: SITE.url + "/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Services", item: SITE.url + "/services" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "Data & Analytics Project Management", item: SITE.url + "/data-project-management-change-leadership" },
    ],
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    mainEntity: faqs.map((f) => ({
      "@type": "Question",
      name: f.q,
      acceptedAnswer: { "@type": "Answer", text: f.a },
    })),
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Analytics project management and change | Alluvium"
  description="Analytics project management and change leadership for Power BI programs. Scope, timelines, training, and adoption so delivery does not stall in the last mile."
  canonicalPath="/data-project-management-change-leadership"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Crumbs
        crumbs={[
          { href: "/", label: "Home" },
          { href: "/services", label: "Services" },
          { label: "Analytics project management" },
        ]}
      />
      <p class="kicker">Services</p>
      <h1>Analytics project management and change leadership</h1>
      <p class="lede">Oversight for analytics and Power BI initiatives: scope, teams, timelines, communication, training, and adoption—so delivery does not stall in the last mile.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="/contact">Book a Session</a></p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <figure class="still bw">
    <img src="/blog/why-month-end-still-takes-a-week-hero.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" />
  </figure>
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>The model can be right and still fail if finance never opens it. We treat adoption as part of delivery, not a slide at the end.</p>
      <h2>What analytics project management covers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Scope, vendors, and timelines for Power BI and analytics work.</li>
        <li>Clear owners for certified models, reports, and refresh.</li>
        <li>Communication and training so the people who need the numbers actually use them.</li>
        <li>Change leadership when a spreadsheet process becomes a governed report.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What this is not</h2>
      <p>Not staff-aug for a chatbot lab. Alluvium is analytics and BI. If conversational analytics is in the plan, it sits on a certified model after that model exists.</p>
      <h2>How the engagement runs</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Name the initiative, the decision it serves, and who has to change how they work.</li>
        <li>Stand up a simple cadence: status, blockers, and adoption metrics that are not vanity.</li>
        <li>Close with a handoff your team can run without us in the room.</li>
      </ol>
      <h2>Analytics project management FAQs</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        {faqs.map((f) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{f.q}</summary>
            <p>{f.a}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <RelatedLinks
    services={[
      { href: "/power-bi-training", label: "Power BI training" },
      { href: "/managed-advisory-retainer", label: "Managed advisory retainer" },
      { href: "/analytics-ai-strategy-roadmap", label: "Analytics strategy roadmap" },
    ]}
    posts={[
      { href: "/blog/nobody-opens-the-dashboard", label: "Nobody opens the dashboard" },
      { href: "/blog/why-month-end-still-takes-a-week", label: "Why month-end still takes a week" },
      { href: "/blog/semantic-model-is-the-product", label: "The semantic model is the product" },
    ]}
  />
  <CtaBand heading="Keep the last mile from stalling" text="A session is enough to see whether the gap is the model, the plan, or adoption." />
</BaseLayout>
